    {
      "Id": 1040319016,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040319,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 15,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉单推电姬粉丝",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "呜哇啊啊啊啊，卡米拉啊啊啊～～～！　/n刚才超棒可是……没走到我这边来啊啊啊～～～～！",
      "BgmFileName": "303",
      "SeFileName": "1431",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403190120",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040319017,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040319,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 16,
      "SpeakerName": "全团推电姬粉丝",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "别说啦别说啦。就算是恶作剧妖精帕克大人，/n也不可能每个人都绕到吧。话说你不是已经拿到Fan Service了吗。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403190130",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040319018,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040319,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 17,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉单推电姬粉丝",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "嗯！　心脏顺利停跳了！　但没想到居然会把观众都卷进来……。/n卡米拉果然就是最棒的啊～～～！！！！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403190140",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040319019,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040319,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 18,
      "SpeakerName": "叶羽单推电姬粉丝",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "哈啊……哈啊……叶羽的赫米亚少女心也太强了……。/n差点以为我要失血过多死掉……你那边还好吗……？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403190150",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040319020,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040319,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 19,
      "SpeakerName": "蕾单推电姬粉丝",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……不行。感觉像被电流连续电了一辈子。/n不过坐13小时飞机僵掉的肌肉彻底松开了……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10403190160",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
